l present tense.","remedy":"Use “My survival instinct started clamoring in a crisis.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":73,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"That survival instinct makes uproar in a crisis-like situation.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000bef:text","row":17378,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うそおっしゃい」","en":"“...Liar.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01767","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00557","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00557"],"en":"Misato: \"...yer kiddin' now.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01767","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000bef:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000c25:text","row":17379,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「ははは」","en":"“Ha ha ha.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01766","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00558","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00558"],"en":"Taichi: \"Hahahah!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01766","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000c25:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000c4f:text","row":17380,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「ねえ先輩」","en":"“Hey, Miyasumi.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01762","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00559","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00559"],"en":"Taichi: \"Say, Senpai.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01762","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000c4f:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000c98:text","row":17381,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい？」","en":"“Yes?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01236","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00560","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00560"],"en":"Misato: \"Yes?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01236","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000c98:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000cc2:text","row":17382,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「明日、海にでも行きませんか？」","en":"“Want to go to the beach tomorrow?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00636","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00561","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00561"],"en":"Taichi: \"Could we still go to the beach, tomorrow?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00636","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000cc2:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The contextual specification is harmless; the remaining issue is tense and fluency.","remedy":"Use fluent English in the correct tense.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":51,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Could we still go to the beach, tomorrow?\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000d1f:text","row":17383,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「……海に？」","en":"“...The beach?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00627","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00562","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00562"],"en":"Misato: \"...the beach?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00627","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000d1f:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000d4d:text","row":17384,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「二人で」","en":"“Just the two of us.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00013","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00563","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00563"],"en":"Taichi: \"The two of us.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00013","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000d4d:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000d94:text","row":17385,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「そーですねぇ」","en":"“I suppose so...”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01696","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00564","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00564"],"en":"Misato: \"Should we, then.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01696","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000d94:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"そーですねぇ is a hesitant agreement such as “I suppose so.” “Should we, then” turns it into a malformed question.","remedy":"Use “Hmm... I suppose so.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":26,"start":0,"text":"Misato: \"Should we, then.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000dbc:text","row":17386,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"部活のことを考えたのかも知れない。","en":"Maybe she was thinking about the club.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02370","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00565","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00565"],"en":"She might just be thinking about what to do about club activities.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","overinterpretation"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02370","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000dbc:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The source proposition survives, with only grammar and slight contextual overstatement.","remedy":"Render it directly and grammatically.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":66,"start":0,"text":"She might just be thinking about what to do about club activities."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000dfe:text","row":17387,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「休憩も必要です」","en":"“We need a break too.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01109","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00566","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00566"],"en":"Taichi: \"Rest and recuperation are also necessary.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01109","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000dfe:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000e4d:text","row":17388,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「……そうですね」","en":"“...Yes, we do.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01392","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00567","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00567"],"en":"Misato: \"...indeed, yes.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01392","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000e4d:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000e9c:text","row":17389,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃ明日は休みにして、パーッと」","en":"“Then let’s take tomorrow off and really cut loose.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00523","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00568","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00568"],"en":"Misato: \"Then tomorrow we rest, aaall out!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","mistranslation"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00523","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000e9c:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"She proposes making tomorrow a day off and cutting loose. “Tomorrow we rest, aaall out” combines rest with an incompatible modifier and omits the idea of going out for fun.","remedy":"Use “Then let’s take tomorrow off and really cut loose.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":43,"start":0,"text":"Misato: \"Then tomorrow we rest, aaall out!\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000ed6:text","row":17390,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"はにかむ。","en":"She smiled shyly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01597","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00569","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00569"],"en":"Shy.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","omission"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01597","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000ed6:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"はにかむ describes her bashful smile or shy reaction. The isolated adjective “Shy” omits the action and does not form a sentence.","remedy":"Use “She smiled bashfully.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":4,"start":0,"text":"Shy."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000ef8:text","row":17391,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"吹っ切れたように見えて、やはり、どこかに惑いがあった。","en":"She looked as though she had put it behind her, yet some uncertainty lingered.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00304","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00570","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00570"],"en":"She did look like she had left behind her past, but of course, there was still some perplexity in there,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00304","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000ef8:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"吹っ切れた means she looked as though she had put her hesitation behind her, not her entire past. “Perplexity in there” is also vague and unidiomatic for lingering uncertainty.","remedy":"Use “She looked as though she had moved past it, but some uncertainty still lingered.”","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":104,"start":0,"text":"She did look like she had left behind her past, but of course, there was still some perplexity in there,"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:00000fe1:text","row":17392,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"どうしても届かない。","en":"I still couldn’t reach her.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00062","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00571","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00571"],"en":"something that I cannot reach no matter what.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00062","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:00000fe1:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0078:0000100d:text","row":17393,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"体を重ねても、なお。","en":"Not even with our bodies joined.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00063","unitId":"ghs-tl:cca0025c:00572","unitIds":["ghs-tl:cca0025c:00572"],"en":"Not even with the overlap of bodies.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00063","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0078:0000100d:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The event remains identifiable; the confirmed issue is English execution rather than semantic substitution.","remedy":"Use natural English with clear agency.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":36,"start":0,"text":"Not even with the overlap of bodies."}]}]}]}
